        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this wonderful four-bedroom semi-detached property with a stunning south west facing rear garden to the market in the exclusive Broadfield Development.\nThe Broadfield Development is located in the heart of Rathcoole and has every amenity imaginable on its doorstep. Within a stone's throw you will find local bars, shops, schools, Avoca and Rathcoole Park along with a host of bus routes, the N7 and M50 road networks, the location is truly next to none. \nElegant and luxurious living accommodation of c. 130 sqm split over three levels consists of; entrance hallway with guest bathroom, large living room with bay window & feature fireplace, fully fitted kitchen with separate utility room and dining room. On the first floor you will find three generous bedrooms (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. \nOn the top floor you will find a further master bedroom with ensuite bathroom and separate storage room. Externally to the rear of the property you will find a fully enclosed superbly maintained garden which benefits from the lowest of maintenance with a highly sought after south west facing orientation perfect for relaxing on them long summer evenings with the use of a wooden shed for storage. The front offers ample off-street parking on a paved driveway. \nNo.3 comes to the market in no less than turnkey condition throughout having been meticulously maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when modifying or upgrading in recent years and boasts an endless list of additional features including four generous bedrooms, four bathrooms, gas fired central heating, beautiful fully fitted kitchen and top-quality fixtures & fittings to name a few! \nEarly viewing is highly advised to appreciate the sheer quality on offer behind the door of this fantastic family home, we are expecting plenty of interest from first time buyers and any growing family looking to settle roots in one of Rathcoole's finest estates. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today. \nAdditional Features; \nc 130 sqm \nBER B\n4 bed 4 bath \nSemi-detached family home \nStunning rear garden\nSunny south west facing orientation \nLowest of maintenance \nPrivate and fully enclosed \nPerfect for summer relaxation \nWooden shed for storage \nExtremely spacious living space \nImmaculate condition throughout \nExclusive development \nGas fired central heating \nSolar panels \nTop quality fixtures and fittings \nFinished to the highest possible standards \nEntrance hallway \nGuest bathroom \nLarge living room with bay window & feature fire \nNew fully fitted kitchen \nDining room \nSeparate utility room \nSplit over 3 floors \nFour generous bedrooms \nBuilt in wardrobes \nFour bathrooms \nAmple storage \nDouble glazed windows \nTop quality blinds \nAmple parking to the front \nPaved driveway \nHeart of Rathcoole Village \nWalking distance to all local amenities \nViewing highly advised \nLocation Location Location \nDirections - Entering Rathcoole at the roundabout next to Avoca, continue through the village on Main Street. When you get towards the top of the village, take the left turn onto Johnstown Road. Continue straight over the mini roundabout onto School Road and continue onto the Kilteel Road then turn right onto Broadfield Manor and continue straight ahead and follow the road around to the left where number 3 will be clearly sign posted on the left. \n"
      },
